{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed by one person so it has many flaws, please point out the flaws and /or downsides, I'll try my best to improve the game design and make it more fun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special thanks to Abdullah Konash who created and shared Arabic Support For Unity plugin.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Guide</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(I apologize for not being able to fix bugs and improve game tutorials at this time, as the game project is stored on a computer currently inaccessible to me.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ending 1:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foraging bees seek aid from another colony and bring it back to home hive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ending 2:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Easy Mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Wax bees craft Mint Royal Jelly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Foraging bees deliver it as a gift to the foreign queen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Guard bees carry out the assassination when the foreign queen is mating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Queen bee eats Mint Royal Jelly to imitate the scent of the foreign queen\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Ending 3:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill all the foreign bees and occupy their hive.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Ending 4:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Normal Mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locate the Shrine of Seasons (entrance lies beneath three stone caves).\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offer three tributes:\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Mint Royal Jelly: Crafted by wax bees.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Sunlight Honey: Collected by foraging bees from sunflowers.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Moonlight Honey: Obtained by guard bees from moonlight flowers at night.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Busy Bee is a relaxing game to get rid of daily stress. Play as a bee and build cells, guard home, collect nectar, do whatever you can to survive the winter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute bees graphics reduce the fear of insects.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 player co-op game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4+2 unique classes and skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375090/extras/874f86270f95f5152f895c95fd7e1f04.avif?t=1757159785\" width=600 height=313 /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than one way to get food and survive the winter,  <br>explore and discover different ways.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375090/extras/66684fc4e420ed0eda0ee63cb90f4635.poster.avif?t=1757159785\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375090/extras/66684fc4e420ed0eda0ee63cb90f4635.webm?t=1757159785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375090/extras/66684fc4e420ed0eda0ee63cb90f4635.mp4?t=1757159785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375090/extras/0ea9230250381a779f1767d475e93d83.poster.avif?t=1757159785\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375090/extras/0ea9230250381a779f1767d475e93d83.webm?t=1757159785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375090/extras/0ea9230250381a779f1767d475e93d83.mp4?t=1757159785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental temperature affects food consumption.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merchant Orcsmarten only sells 3 items every day.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Easy mode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2375090/8c155b2cfa98840ba034663ffc40e96e8d37b512.jpg"},{"name":"Normal mode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2375090/d90b680f13515e2f9fccebefa09310cfc6b582e5.jpg"},{"name":"Hard mode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2375090/b82f81320b277d345a36ea5251ae8bedc50da9e0.jpg"},{"name":"Model bee","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2375090/e17c3be966775f793cfd1acb514e779d0d82478c.jpg"},{"name":"Killer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2375090/2eec7211190657e4d4ceeca02925bd473fb2e985.jpg"},{"name":"Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2375090/fe466fe26ddb1e68a73fd16e97fa6e46854da7c7.jpg"},{"name":"Invader","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2375090/0f9ec160ce77dd2f43e4ecb09b16a4ba4eac34df.jpg"},{"name":"Revenger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2375090/27d5c0b5c5fed14fe3582d27be86b459af23a818.jpg"},{"name":"Friendly wasp","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2375090/a3e96adc00268343e56ed3b005fdc9b408c375f