eign queen is mating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Queen bee eats Mint Royal Jelly to imitate the scent of the foreign queen\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Ending 3:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill all the foreign bees and occupy their hive.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Ending 4:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Normal Mode)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locate the Shrine of Seasons (entrance lies beneath three stone caves).\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offer three tributes:\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Mint Royal Jelly: Crafted by wax bees.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Sunlight Honey: Collected by foraging bees from sunflowers.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Moonlight Honey: Obtained by guard bees from moonlight flowers at night.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Busy Bee is a relaxing game to get rid of daily stress. Play as a bee and build cells, guard home, collect nectar, do whatever you can to survive the winter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute bees graphics reduce the fear of insects.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 player co-op game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4+2 unique classes and skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375090/extras/874f86270f95f5152f895c95fd7e1f04.avif?t=1757159785\" width=600 height=313 /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than one way to get food and survive the winter,  <br>explore and discover different wa